    "created_at": "2024-07-11T12:55:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-11T12:55:05Z",
    "body": "Defining it in terms of the `ch` unit is a possibility, but might be less good for some writing systems where many characters are significantly wider than \"0\" (or where \"0\" isn't even supported in the primary font for the language, so it'd end up based on a fallback).\r\n\r\nWhen the language of the element is Chinese/Japanese/Korean, perhaps it'd be better to use the `ic` unit.\r\n",
